Documentation
=============

Please read the supplied !Help file before using this application. This
may be opened by clicking Menu over the !RDPClient icon in the Filer and
choosing the "App. '!RDPClient' => Help" menu item.


New in this release
===================

Changes since 0.79:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

* Based on rdesktop 1.6.0 sources.
* Compatible with Windows Vista and Windows 7.
* Synchronisation of "lock" keys with remote computer.
* Support for full colour mouse pointers.
* Support for 15bit screen mode on Iyonix nVidia FX series graphics cards.
* Screen mode selection support for ViewFinder graphics cards. 


